    <rect width="700" height="340" fill="url(#grid)"/>
    <path d="M110 210 L155 255 L260 130" fill="none" stroke="#FFFFFF" stroke-width="6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" opacity="0.5"/>
    <path d="M440 240 L485 285 L590 160" fill="none" stroke="#FFFFFF" stroke-width="6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" opacity="0.28"/>
  </svg>
  <div class="hero-inner">
    <p class="kicker">Testing, Reimagined</p>
    <h1>SDET Tech: Where AI Meets Quality Engineering</h1>
  </div>
</div>

<main>
  <div class="byline">
    <div class="avatar">TV</div>
    <div class="byline-text">
      <div class="byline-name">Taniya Vishwakarma</div>
      <div class="byline-meta">September 24, 2026 · 2 min read</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <p class="lede"><strong>SDET Tech is repositioning QA from a reactive checkpoint into a proactive, AI-driven engine for release confidence.</strong> The company builds around two connected pillars: service depth across the testing lifecycle, and platform intelligence through its product, SDET360.AI.</p>

  <hr>

  <h2>Pillar 1 — The Unified Testing Umbrella</h2>
  <p>Instead of specializing in one niche, SDET Tech covers the full spectrum a release needs, under one roof.</p>

  <h3>Automation Testing</h3>
  <ul>
    <li>Maintainable frameworks — <strong>Selenium, Cypress, Playwright</strong> — wired directly into CI/CD for faster, more reliable releases.</li>
  </ul>

  <h3>Performance Testing</h3>
  <ul>
    <li>Load, stress, and scalability validation built to surface bottlenecks before peak traffic does.</li>
  </ul>

  <h3>Accessibility & Cybersecurity</h3>
  <ul>
    <li>WCAG/ADA compliance checks and penetration testing, so inclusion and security are never afterthoughts.</li>
  </ul>

  <h3>ETL / Database Testing</h3>
  <ul>
    <li>Deep reconciliation checks that guarantee data integrity across migrations and BI pipelines.</li>
  </ul>

  <hr>

  <h2>Pillar 2 — SDET360.AI, the Intelligence Layer</h2>
  <p>This is the differentiator: one AI platform that compresses the whole QA lifecycle into a single workflow.</p>

  <ul>
    <li><strong>Requirement → Story</strong> — BRDs become acceptance-criteria-ready user stories in minutes.</li>
    <li><strong>Story → Test Case</strong> — AI drafts test cases, edge scenarios, and test data, keeping humans in charge of the final quality bar.</li>
    <li><strong>Test Case → Script</strong> — Automation code is generated across Playwright, Selenium, Cypress, Robot, and Appium, then plugged straight into Jenkins or GitHub Actions.</li>
    <li><strong>Execution → Insight</strong> — Real-time dashboards flag coverage gaps before they become production incidents.</li>
  </ul>

  <div class="stat-row">
    <div class="stat"><div class="stat-num">2x</div><div class="stat-label">Faster story &amp; test case generation</div></div>
    <div class="stat"><div class="stat-num">3x</div><div class="stat-label">Faster automation code generation</div></div>
    <div class="stat"><div class="stat-num">2x</div><div class="stat-label">Savings on maintenance</div></div>
  </div>

  <p class="closing">Explore more at <a href="https://sdettech.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">sdettech.com</a></p>
</main>

</body>
</html>
